// GAME-8's sample conversation (DialogueTest.lvl / DialogueFlows.edscript).
title: Gate
---
<<set $name = "traveller">>
Guard: Halt! Who goes there?
-> A friend.
    <<set $trusted = true>>
    Guard: Then pass, friend.
-> None of your business. <<if not $trusted>>
    Guard: Then you stay out.
    <<jump Refused>>
<<if $trusted and $visits >= 1>>
    Guard: Back again, {$name}?
<<elseif $trusted>>
    Guard: Mind the stairs, {$name}.
<<else>>
    Guard: Move along.
<<endif>>
<<set $visits = $visits + 1>>
<<event open-gate north>>
===
title: Refused
---
Guard: Begone.
===
